"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果拟在iOS 27引入多模型选择机制，支持第三方AI接入系统功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/afdf27ddb1ba4085708ff851b867f99e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果计划在iOS 27、iPadOS 27及macOS 27中引入多模型选择机制，内部代号为“Extensions”。该架构允许用户在Siri、写作工具及图像生成等Apple Intelligence功能中，自主选择并调用第三方生成式AI模型，实现系统级插件化调度。目前，Google与Anthropic的模型已进入适配测试阶段，ChatGPT亦有望作为可选方案。此举标志着苹果正从单一AI能力提供者转向平台化模型调度架构，将AI能力抽象为系统级资源。通过将iPhone等终端打造为AI能力的分发与调度中心，苹果旨在提升生态灵活性与兼容度。在Tim Cook即将卸任的背景下，该战略由继任者John Ternus主导，旨在通过操作系统层面的AI调度层设计，重塑移动生态中的AI竞争格局，使设备成为多模型协同的运行载体。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">三星电子确认研发Galaxy Glasses智能眼镜，将搭载Android XR系统</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/28c9d155ab509d998cdd481391c9de2e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">三星电子在第一季度财报电话会议中正式宣布进军AI眼镜市场，计划推出名为“Galaxy Glasses”的智能眼镜产品。该设备将搭载谷歌Android XR操作系统，旨在提供沉浸式、多模态AI体验，直接对标Meta的智能眼镜产品。除核心眼镜外，三星还将同步发布代号为“Galaxy Buds Able”的真无线耳机，该产品预计采用夹式设计并集成骨传导技术。三星表示，得益于内存市场需求强劲，其芯片业务同比增长近50倍，但受限于市场高需求，供应短缺状况或将持续至2027年。通过此次布局，三星意在利用其在芯片制造与硬件集成领域的深厚积淀，在AI驱动的下一代移动计算赛道中占据主动权，构建差异化的智能穿戴生态系统。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 发布 GPT-5.5 Instant 模型，提升聊天机器人准确性并减少幻觉</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8d3580ac9274197f3f8d3936b4e1bb86.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 正式将 ChatGPT 默认模型升级至 GPT-5.5 Instant，该模型重点优化了回复的简洁性与准确性。通过减少冗余表达及表情符号，GPT-5.5 Instant 旨在提供更直观的交互体验。在性能指标上，该模型表现显著：内部评估显示其“幻觉”声明减少了 52.5%，用户标记的事实错误率降低了 37.3%，在医疗、法律及金融等高风险领域表现出更强的可靠性。此次更新已面向所有用户开放，付费用户享有三个月的 GPT-5.3 Instant 过渡期，以确保平滑切换。OpenAI 表示，Instant 系列在事实性方面取得了全面进步，旨在通过更精准的信息输出提升用户的工作效率与交互质量。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布10款金融AI智能体，深度集成办公软件并接入权威金融数据</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b71cbb1ef0b58e51f834cbf694c2fb5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic正式发布10款专为金融服务设计的AI智能体，旨在覆盖投行、资管及合规审查等核心业务环节。该系列工具支持撰写会议推介材料、审阅复杂财务报表及处理合规审查升级，标志着Anthropic从AI编程领域向高专业度金融市场扩张。为实现深度办公协同，这些智能体已实现与Excel、PowerPoint及Outlook的无缝集成，并接入邓白氏和穆迪等权威机构数据，确保输出内容的专业性与准确性。此外，Anthropic已与高盛、黑石等金融巨头成立合资公司，加速技术在企业端的渗透。此举将AI从单纯的聊天机器人转化为直接参与工作流的数字化员工，对传统金融信息服务商构成直接竞争压力，推动金融行业生产力变革。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Amazon SageMaker引入AI代理支持自然语言驱动模型开发</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/86ea4ba2e6b32b18dfbd834765c536bc.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亚马逊宣布在机器学习平台Amazon SageMaker中引入AI代理能力，旨在通过自然语言交互重构模型开发流程。开发者无需手动处理复杂API调用与数据格式转换，仅需通过自然语言描述场景，即可触发端到端建模。系统内置Kiro AI代理工具，提供九项预置技能，覆盖数据集检查、训练策略推荐、任务调度及模型部署等全生命周期，并以Jupyter Notebook形式输出可复用代码。该平台支持接入Claude Code等第三方代理，并兼容Llama、Qwen、DeepSeek及亚马逊自研Nova等主流开源与商用模型。此次升级标志着机器学习开发从工具链驱动向智能体驱动演进，通过自动化编排显著压缩开发周期，强化了云平台在AI生产力工具链中的核心地位。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
